    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aliens have landed and they\u2019re starving for pizza!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>10,000 Pizzas Please</i>, you\u2019ll build a fully automated pizza factory to serve wave after wave of hungry extraterrestrial customers. Gather ingredients, lay down rails, power your machines and craft the most efficient production line in the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/3277bf957ee06c7a7ba0a2fd620c7882.poster.avif?t=1752248889\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/3277bf957ee06c7a7ba0a2fd620c7882.webm?t=1752248889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/3277bf957ee06c7a7ba0a2fd620c7882.mp4?t=1752248889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan. Build. Deliver.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use limited energy and resources to create the ultimate pizza pipeline... Every ingredient has a cost, and every machine consumes energy, efficiency is the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/177f7baab1f8a8150677f8e24d7ed607.poster.avif?t=1752248889\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/177f7baab1f8a8150677f8e24d7ed607.webm?t=1752248889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/177f7baab1f8a8150677f8e24d7ed607.mp4?t=1752248889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Ways to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <strong>Mission Mode</strong>, where you tackle handcrafted challenges, or <strong>Free Factory Mode</strong>, where you build without limits and experiment freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/211a2327f7697fa21b81dc3fdfe676c0.poster.avif?t=1752248889\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/211a2327f7697fa21b81dc3fdfe676c0.webm?t=1752248889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/211a2327f7697fa21b81dc3fdfe676c0.mp4?t=1752248889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automation Meets Cooking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From raw dough to sizzling perfection, udeploy a range of machines: Dough Pressers, Sauce Dispensers, Chees and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 tasty ingredients</strong>: Mix &amp; match for hundreds of combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 machine types</strong>: Automate like a true factory master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy &amp; cost systems</strong>:\u00a0Think smart, spend smarter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Game Modes</strong>:\u00a0Mission Mode &amp; Free Factory Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>:\u00a0Design, test, optimize, repeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean, colorful visuals</strong>:\u00a0Watch your factory flourish in style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you satisfy the galaxy\u2019s appetite?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist Now!..</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aliens have landed and they\u2019re starving for pizza!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>10,000 Pizzas Please</i>, you\u2019ll build a fully automated pizza factory to serve wave after wave of hungry extraterrestrial customers. Gather ingredients, lay down rails, power your machines and craft the most efficient production line in the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/3277bf957ee06c7a7ba0a2fd620c7882.poster.avif?t=1752248889\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/3277bf957ee06c7a7ba0a2fd620c7882.webm?t=1752248889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/3277bf957ee06c7a7ba0a2fd620c7882.mp4?t=1752248889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan. Build. Deliver.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use limited energy and resources to create the ultimate pizza pipeline... Every ingredient has a cost, and every machine consumes energy, efficiency is the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/177f7baab1f8a8150677f8e24d7ed607.poster.avif?t=1752248889\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/177f7baab1f8a8150677f8e24d7ed607.webm?t=1752248889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/177f7baab1f8a8150677f8e24d7ed607.mp4?t=1752248889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Ways to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <strong>Mission Mode</strong>, where you tackle handcrafted challenges, or <strong>Free Factory Mode</strong>, where you build without limits and experiment freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/211a2327f7697fa21b81dc3fdfe676c0.poster.avif?t=1752248889\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/211a2327f7697fa21b81dc3fdfe676c0.webm?t=1752248889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798960/extras/211a2327f7697fa21b81dc3fdfe676c0.mp4?t=1752248889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automation Meets Cooking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From raw dough to sizzling perfection, udeploy a range of machines: Dough Pressers, Sauce Dispensers, Chees and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 tasty ingredients</strong>: Mix &amp; match for hundreds of combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 machine types</strong>: Automate like a true factory master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy &amp; cost systems</strong>:\u00a0Think smart, spend smarter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Game Modes</strong>:\u00a0Mission Mode &amp; Free Factory Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>:\u00a0Design, test, optimize, repeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean, colorful visuals</strong>:\u00a0Watch your factory flourish in style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you satisfy the galaxy\u2019s appetite?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist Now!..</h2>",
